<Layout title="Call Kevin | Contact 800Roofs.com" description="Contact Kevin, owner of 800Roofs.com, to discuss your roof. Verified phone number and business contact details are awaiting confirmation."><section class="page-intro wrap"><div class="eyebrow">CONTACT KEVIN</div><h1>Your roof.<br/>Let’s talk.</h1></section><article class="wrap content">{business.phone ? <a class="button" href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>Call Kevin · {business.phoneDisplay || business.phone}</a> : <p class="notice">Kevin’s phone number: awaiting verification. The Call Now links will become click-to-call links once a verified number is added.</p>}<p>When calling, have your property location and a brief description of your roofing question ready. Ask about available services and next steps.</p><p>Business location and hours: awaiting confirmation.</p></article></Layout>
